      "id": "ev-lettera-per-elena-13",
      "summary": "Elena almost writes \"sei Pietro\" in the book. Instead she writes about the lagoon, then says his name only to the water.",
      "characterIds": [
        "elena-marini",
        "bruna",
        "mirella-marini"
      ],
      "locationIds": [
        "caffe-brenta",
        "scaffale-libro",
